with.input:
Write the routing record from this dispatch result. If it says nothing was sent or the forward failed, record that and the reason it gives.

${outputs.forward_email.raw}

Expected output: A routing record with: Message ID, Subject, From, Department, Sensitivity level, Reason, Recipients the email was forwarded to, and Outcome (forwarded, already forwarded, not sent or failed, with the reason). Nothing estimated or made up.
